{"game": "escape-from-duckov", "language": "english", "appid": 3167020, "month": "2026-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1782864000, "end_date": 1783468799, "month_true_total": 194, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-09-26 01:38:24 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "229893569", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045126855", "personaname": "Lightesword", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Lightesword/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 1743, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 761, "last_played": 1783631278, "avatar": "6cb22f55a84b8a2d090d6c61a14d048fe65d6ad8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very great game. I have done a few extraction shooters that were okay, but this one does it better. Balanced is the perfect setting, it has difficulty but doesn't punish you too bad. The best thing is there's multiplayer mods for this game too.", "timestamp_created": 1783468212, "timestamp_updated": 1783468212, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229890546", "author": {"steamid": "76561198134089147", "personaname": "Friendly", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/32479/", "num_games_owned": 214, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4939, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2346, "last_played": 1784075239, "avatar": "d7bfec871c4246d3431753d875ac85b41106c79d"}, "language": "english", "review": "insanely great game. addicting, tasteful, everything I love about PVE and extraction shooters in one game. Saved me from arc raiders.", "timestamp_created": 1783465205, "timestamp_updated": 1783465205, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229889802", "author": {"steamid": "76561198865411653", "personaname": "china", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/1989kmhpeek/", "num_games_owned": 426, "num_reviews": 147, "playtime_forever": 591, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 396, "last_played": 1787004935, "avatar": "40e5baab4e1c0ac79c53c6637a45bac5e36f4439"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nikita copied EFD", "timestamp_created": 1783464484, "timestamp_updated": 1783464494, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.430243760347366333", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229885435", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139139418", "personaname": "SnowyDrift", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/snowydrift/", "num_games_owned": 3304, "num_reviews": 77, "playtime_forever": 16645, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16645, "last_played": 1783469709, "avatar": "8c62dcf8f539e763fb5eeeb5a4d2e845183824c6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Cute isometric looter shooter, very satisfying even just vanilla and progression is at a good pace. There are some nice mods in the workshop as well. Even after the storyline, just another run or two is easy to pick up.", "timestamp_created": 1783460318, "timestamp_updated": 1786275994, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54145205020904541", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "hardware": {"system_ram": "65219", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900K", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090", "vram_size": 24138}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229878181", "author": {"steamid": "76561198374488806", "personaname": "Tubby", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198374488806/", "num_games_owned": 302, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1653, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 537, "last_played": 1784473058, "avatar": "31dd471cb14f8636dac6eb853dbdf5c8a9ca1e39"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you are Scared of Tarkov (bc Hacker and / or PVP in general) \r\nI would say definetly give this a Try", "timestamp_created": 1783454079, "timestamp_updated": 1783454079, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32637", "os": "Windows 10", "cpu_name": "11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-11700 @ 2.50GHz", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070", "vram_size": 8018}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229871832", "author": {"steamid": "76561198052399449", "personaname": "ceoofwar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198052399449/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 3174, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2208, "last_played": 1787970061, "avatar": "b45e67966f7bda5e2b8b0e903ff404f9f7b80b8c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am having a good time with this game, it's better than I had expected, and I knew going into it I would likely enjoy it. The weapon variety feels great, there are clear reasons why you would use this gun over that gun and so forth, there are some weapons that are significantly better than others and those are a lot of fun to find and use. I like the dying mechanic that Dark Souls does, you have to make it back to your point of death to retrieve your items.\r\n\r\nThe thing that is burning me out a bit is the tedium of questing, they seem to just never end, and some of them are just annoying. The fishing is pretty simple, but getting bait to be able to fish is annoying. I think there is a vendor you can buy it from, but if you want to craft it, good luck. It's just slow to progress that area of the game. Other than those, some of the quests are very specific and that is totally fine, I just wish they would give you, at least when you pick up the quest, the mandatory item you need to go do the thing you need to do. My complaints are minor, as this is the primary method of progression and the point of a looter shooter, so it's not a huge deal, it is a endorphin dump when you find that thing you've been trying to find for bit, so it's got a lot going for it.", "timestamp_created": 1783448996, "timestamp_updated": 1783448996, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}]}